Stage 0 check: `claude/zugaenge` (spec v3-01) reports only the door as access; quicksave
Stage 1 walls: 44 Cw around lane and door (quickfort label walls) - first the door side
Stage 2 traps: 12 Ts (mouth side), 6 Tw (door third), 2 Tc (last line) = 20 mechanisms; orders at the mechanic's workshop/metalsmith first
Stage 3 niche: 3 CF + 9 Cw + rack/stand; stair from z132 into the niche by hand; squad 'shooters' station in the niche
Stage 4 check: `python -m df_llm_helper defense status` (>= 70 % loaded), stone stockpile near the lane
Note: citizens/merchants: the door is only reachable through the lane (traps do not fire on citizens; the depot must be reached from the map edge, not through the lane)
